r and cuffs, no tie or scarf\n- dark navy pleated skirt ending at mid-thigh, belt at waistline\n- black block-heeled pumps\n- Keep the subject from Image 1 recognizable in every view.\n- Keep handedness, asymmetry, markings, costume, hardware, and color placement consistent.\n- Use clean anime cel-shaded illustration style with sharp linework throughout the sheet.\n\nVISIBLE TEXT\nAll labels must be English only. Keep labels short and legible. Do not invent lore paragraphs.\n\nNEGATIVE CONSTRAINTS\nNo extra character or object, identity drift, species drift, wardrobe drift, material drift, inconsistent markings, changed proportions, missing extremities, duplicated limbs, merged views, overlapping panels, logo, watermark, or unrelated decoration.", 0, ""], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 78, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 184, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image_b", "label": "image_b", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image_b"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 193, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "grounding_px"}, "shape": 7, "name": "grounding_px", "label": "grounding_px", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "grounding_px"}, {"widget": {"name": "system_prompt"}, "shape": 7, "name": "system_prompt", "label": "system_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "system_prompt"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "Krea2EditGroundedEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [316.80535888671875, 243.7548065185547], "pos": [223.05128479003906, 1146.6719970703125], "id": 119, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-krea2edit", "ver": "1.2.2", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"prompt": true}, "Node name for S&R": "Krea2EditGroundedEncode"}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CON